  "body": "Seems like this is not the correct behavior from a UX perspective. If a user set the playback rate to something nondefault, it should stay that way when the src changes.\r\n\r\nI see the current behavior is [specified as a requirement](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#loading-the-media-resource) in the spec.\r\n\r\nHowever in #992 / #956 it seemed this was being discussed as undesired behavior (and if I understood correctly this was not supposed to have been implemented in Blink).\r\n\r\nYet as of my recent testing this behavior seems to exist in Chrome.",
